5;252mexercised with an inline fixture. Invalid rows are reported on stderr with line number,\u001b[m              \r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mreason and raw text, skipped, and the valid rows still print; exit is 1 when any row was\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mrejected, 2 when the header/file/args are unusable.\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[38;5;252mDecisions you may want to refine:\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[38;5;102m·\u001b[38;5;252m Threshold is exclusive (\u001b[48;5;234mqty < 3\u001b[49m), and \u001b[48;5;234m--threshold N\u001b[49m overrides it.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;102m·\u001b[38;5;252m \u001b[48;5;234mqty == 0\u001b[49m prints with \u001b[48;5;234m# out of stock\u001b[49m rather than being dropped.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;102m·\u001b[38;5;252m Rejected rows are skipped, not fatal (exit 1); the header/file/args path is fatal\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m  (exit 2). Aborting on the first bad row would be a one-line change.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;102m·\u001b[38;5;252m Duplicate detection is case-insensitive (\u001b[48;5;234mTea\u001b[49m then \u001b[48;5;234mtea\u001b[49m collides) — drop \u001b[48;5;234m.lower()\u001b[49m in\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m  \u001b[48;5;234mseen\u001b[49m for case-sensitive.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;102m·\u001b[38;5;252m Because the module name has a hyphen, \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/caf-extended-1595/project/test_pantry_check.py\u0007test_pantry_check.py\u001b[24m\u001b]8;;\u0007 loads it by path via\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m  \u001b[48;5;234mimportlib\u001b[49m instead of \u001b[48;5;234mimport pantry_check\u001b[49m.\u001b[m\u001b[38;113H\u001b[38;5;243mchecking\u001b[m\n\u001b[4G\u001b[?25h"]
